            "focusAreas": ["hygiene", "health"],
            "description": "Free hot showers, towels and hygiene kits every Wednesday morning in the church hall. Walk in, no ID needed.\n\nWe have two private shower rooms, so there may be a short wait. Sign up at the front table when you arrive, and we'll call your name. Each shower is twenty minutes. While you wait, there's coffee, breakfast and a clothing rack with socks, underwear and jackets in most sizes.\n\nHygiene kits have soap, shampoo, a toothbrush, toothpaste, deodorant and pads or tampons. Take one for yourself and one for a friend.\n\nWe're always looking for volunteers to fold towels and serve breakfast, and we gladly take new socks and travel-size toiletries.",
